# Critical Warning byte of the NVMe SMART / Health Information log page
# (NVMe Base Specification 2.x). Bit 1 is a temperature condition, not media
# or controller damage, so it is reported separately from health_failed. Every
# other set bit, including the reserved bits 6-7, counts as a health failure.
